{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1387,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f21faa1206d0a927bd8f6ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "安禅不必须山水，灭得心中火自凉\r\n……就是一直喊冷才会觉得冷的。\r\n所以只要喊说温暖就会……阿嚏！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e1b4505fb6aaf49acd43ab5679db638558196bff23a772d91a056aaff3fd7c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:879fe145502b40a015d7e730",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这套衣服看运动竞赛也不错呢。\r\n你喜欢哪种竞赛呢？\r\n……除了我的比赛以外的啦！笨蛋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abbc578437e44632190a1e8f8d1f0c77a73347c6bf780b0b86f3de77f37631f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7de2f20a8ccc35d5e6953ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵──呵呵呵！哦──呵呵呵！\r\n喔──呵呵呵！……请作答，何者是\r\n圣王的正确笑声？你一定知道吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "99860fa6f0f77318e5b0de01d81eb228589b3c26451ad2e38220596d18366b18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a850bd47a60e52fc0781b203",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "采珠前辈跟青竹两人都很有个性，\r\n但实力也是真材实料。之前与她们\r\n一起并跑练习时我亲身见识到了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83bb79e7c55c39c950d5a9a0713f418ab3bb133bb25e3675be4f6e770c706e76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9be956036b20d0b3d3f3e718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当我将这职务交接出去的那一天，\r\n你会说些什么呢？虽然说……\r\n那一天还相当遥远啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "beb07fb2992bbc289a3d936926e769e096e2a247d3b2a187cd6f33bf4daa82a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c926abede53dbb711a0cb70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特别周跟川上下次补考总该\r\n合格了吧……我以后再也不想\r\n陪她们读书了喔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8c9850e8a9a70f70119745fa21b9333660d4a4ce76ee47b4a015228016411f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f12e39ff72404ad38364741",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条头带可不会轻易松开喔。\r\n今天早上乌拉拉替我\r\n绑得紧～紧的……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a028916fc4597594746c6417dd884f1ccd0f1db3f23a6cee163153db39dcd65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89c59dd545826c47143ca3b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想休息放松时请跟我说。\r\n我将赋予你准备两人份甜食的权利，\r\n以保我们能够继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba43a969c2437f3f27a6c9f7cfa582a2b511c4d78ca1848b047fbfbda24b439a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55a3815e03093978fe52a3b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "发尾有点失去卷度了……\r\n毕竟下午的练习也很严苛呢，\r\n等一下得重新卷好才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c3632aef346c44eca598e8193943459506104850d80d27b3607fb1edc585155",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd767ae5eb21ef1015354de8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在感谢祭上也一样……请注意言行，\r\n别在支持我的粉丝前丢脸喔？毕竟\r\n你是我这一流赛马娘的签约训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09be6785d7251f466af334c1f1bb5198a560d8085842c18ac12504685b9b3849",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51c90988ce3a861bc57551bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热……就算再热……！\r\n这套服装就是要\r\n配上手套才算完美……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce3cc14d97dec31557258eff611485c7a1c9ff3f42f33258f1978564abf68b23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a72fd90e0349ec42f8240377",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正值艺术之秋，听场管乐演奏会吧？\r\n舞台上的音色与观众席的不同，\r\n听起来别有一番乐趣……非常棒喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0303f151e7ccd922b0537dbd51e0ea9c10b7856b1c46fd9167af1a06317a6dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00e2927e64c84871cb1a471b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……是不是拿掉第二个钮扣比较好？\r\n数码偶尔会用热烈的眼神看我，\r\n嘴里念着「钮扣还在」……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7bc15feae4406638fd545f9589e61180b6dbe81b77b334bc19527b640748907",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58927e4f25d0d08159cd97d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想听圣王为你加油？可以啊！\r\n去准备太鼓吧！……快点啊，\r\n事前准备都是你的职责吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c9532e746edcc21c8be7e0b661f94a8d464d092fa30d7cfc41e72b7b85a66fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:058eabf026d2757470a3bc6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「服装是心灵的装束，高贵的颜色能\r\n使心灵更高贵」……曾有人这么告诉\r\n我。虽然我猜那个人应该不记得了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2def8177000101ef031f80a5d4edf20166747a2d5aff787a984b76211888e544",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fc60c2537c9bd1181aba5b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タオルケットとかないかしら？木陰\r\nでクラフトさんが寝てて。風邪でも\r\nひいたら大変でしょうに…まったく",
      "source_fingerprint": "2224e86295d544d0cbebfb3931d39cea30cc027e6f22c1656313e88736a30a6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9997247fc296bdadeb19a94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いまだにオフのシーザリオさんに\r\n話しかけられると脳が処理でき\r\nないのよね…早く慣れないと。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05763d4a179fe05a332938335671106945d3f9f69769cbfeda2c5497dc2c7be9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fac01638fc21990ece864c2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "己の筋を是が非でも通すために、\r\n決して譲らない姿勢…！\r\nスイープさん、いいじゃない！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54855b032a8d03cc0506af19a0b9a38e77af8b64eb133bbff7b7c6b8d04ee13e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83ba312a78df995135b53f3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "期待に応えつつ、いい意味で期待を\r\n裏切らなければならない…\r\n大変よね、ヴィルシーナさん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b265726558a38f42918a6622ec73d8fed01f19616ecf4eb4cba63b63e888c021",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff860212bb499453f95c3474",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カワカミさんがせっかく考えて\r\nくれたポーズですものね…\r\n一流のポーズ…んん～…えいっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c82ca77feb68b24e682d64e773fde617e8f268d1bef733d771fed711bde9c146",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1be05cb5e03fae9615e1f556",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遠くからでも私とわかる？当然ね！\r\nキングは、朝日よりも輝いて…え？\r\nアクセサリーが反射してるだけ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a5fcdbe5f6ada5b9058953b7ca809754bb9bd58463781ca4b3b50696ac1cd3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4c0080fa9f90753b5e5239d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お昼の量には気を使わないと…\r\nこの衣装、食べ過ぎるとすぐに\r\nラインに出ちゃうのよ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46292716e6a58aeb2805fceabd0c975e378e35ce77c0fa27f2a9b0e681112326",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeda1d588badccd07be9cd76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "装飾が光を反射するから、夜半の\r\nトレーニングも安心…な、わけない\r\nでしょ！なんだと思っているの！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f487159dd922712a6b3b61e38b46119ed767705e9687f2fbe7e762e24dfb120d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8882e52b19e8318b3e27714f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ブーケの花にも一流のこだわりを。\r\nせっかくなら春に咲く、\r\n生き生きとした花がいいわね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bd03c0931e1ee446c6de5f27aa536533fc2a68a454a443dad157767fefdd75e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:959eaded55a140bc9262b084",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真夏の太陽もキングの衣装の前では\r\n引き立て役に過ぎないわ！…って\r\n白飛びしちゃう！日陰に行くわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc00a6a62526f90fb3b19163944a5495f49b1a8cc8fb2004ee930347d8b9d184",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f191d68e2a884c04a4af03df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋は次の年に向けて栄養を蓄える\r\n季節でもあるの！コツコツ積み重ね\r\n来年も大輪の花を咲かせるわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "324fef4835a55d7bf381069d2888f16f5c2954f7c0070f8a1505083abc632070",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b2f39ec67102ce1977ef786",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一流は寒い日の起床だって\r\n常勝であるべき！布団から出るのが\r\n辛いなら、叩き起こしてあげるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15d089feca786f02ccf4f0177d7d04ef6256e6d4925653f661c21e07bb327cf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58e34b8a2faf3ead49805ca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "細かい注文を何度もしちゃった\r\nけれど、妥協や諦めはしたくない。\r\nこれこそが、私のドレスよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a4aa505aac3143acf4f4c95561b2b9e395a7a96b4230f315c0dd2776b1d4845",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:603cc788ee805fe827a5c5a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まだ成長の余地のあるデザインよ…\r\nでも『私』は気に入っているの！\r\nたとえあの人がなんと言おうとね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29f0b0f6ebc5b96548d6dff6f92f21b87a16b1e161cce8f540cb60beb076a43c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d1e176eed9a095faf730027",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可是圣王的训练啊。\r\n你当然是准备了一流的计划\r\n来的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd11b5ad18968711de69c623cae410673283048c07ed87bdcde6313f9ebab5df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c55bbdbe774b6aaed30c8d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いくわよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64856ba922376708d285340e268f38bbc0ce8ec2f37c154d0c625bbb54b632d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f112cfa1bdfd91fdfb87cc2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快，开始吧。\r\n我已经做好了完美的准备了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84f23617cb850c21a8b87472fae6c688971e71d66cd789660fba3363e604512a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fbf49f4da3aaf6f96049cd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣王的时间是连一秒都不可以浪费的。\r\n我可没赋予你浪费时间的权利吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4de9b9be20b4873a0428ba7da937c7bb7681240d98ca99f6bf6db64c376f789",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90736e67c95e4c096ff32664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵、呵、呵，\r\n让你看看什么叫作差距。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cda7b0711da640f484863f7844fb86427125ed1505da0ea86c5d4969e6753b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f63b142be456de5cc0004d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要不停下脚步，\r\n就一定能掌握荣耀。\r\n我是这么坚信着的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2a21da0899541f9ae6a12625f3b46060377affd878f7533fa66f52c519bb688",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33695689cf28fa1451356c3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要得到所有人的认可，\r\n就必须在所有人都看不到的\r\n地方也持续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80e06b381bd2a9750ae34bc3fd3005130fbda642c2c4059683f4874b3caa8fc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe8c0814415488aa7acd005d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你知道吗？看起来很完美的圣王\r\n其实还没有完全成形呢。\r\n也就是我还有成长空间的意思！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2f7186a319af0c7eefed3dfb3cc0e39c700161f87f9703ba0b80b9a24a9dcc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbc3ece0c4d290b37aabd898",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有什么训练是\r\n圣王没办法完成的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6146b6e1ce29ba5dc52a9c27b08a68acda2527a8694f62862f12ace153f38a7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07fde4f64294b990cea5042c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，要开始训练啰。\r\n快，你快准备呼喊口号！\r\n你要负责带起圣王的情绪！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d9947217aad510edb222974f08af3806b9d3237880e108e4690dd9963902998",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc3b7aaccaa6fe186512a5ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要缔造好成绩粉丝自然不离不弃，\r\n我总是把眼光放在更高的目标。\r\n圣王就该永远抬头看向远方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2c40be814a38782276e9f75af783cfe89559281bd6719e653e88ad6ef813977",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f43a91f46ae4033bc9a32c19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "影片拍好后待会也让我看看。\r\n我想确认自己的舞步，\r\n镜子跟影片看起来感觉完全不同呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60e429e4e3122f5598da406ed603eacbff60298c6cfed0032a1d557bbed4b7c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fea18cd0a01647b21727e0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "观众的眼光可是很残酷的。\r\n我得好好表现，让大家看见\r\n我是个值得支持的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75574e792cbff2c8acc98d8cf94770eb3f0a0911b512558f1ae38f7c966b45f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:819ed7c4b6fe0a4359fd26ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论身处何处，我都要\r\n用自身的光彩让当下辉煌。\r\n为此得先好好练习对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d23390429b4a555356c524c62da00a97c1c1793339822d3b974afc0a28ca92fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97ef369f613c093bfb0b84a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有种强劲只能在一路都\r\n深受声援的选手身上看到……\r\n所以我才会想获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b218eca141deac361fed830844f02308cd5cdf9146da6d8c3d370e8f5ca08b25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cda322632bf70a8376e0155",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有些话只有一直在我身边的人才\r\n说得出来吧？要是想声援我，\r\n就说些配得上圣王的话来听听吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "29e70104cec9acdf56fab5e51a5496fc4b7e97b5bbbf536a48afe6eca4415969",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2764adaaecab36b3cec6eeca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このキングが衣装に着られるなんて\r\nまっぴらごめんよ！\r\nしっかり己を磨かないと！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dad0f4ecb3e2363dc9d487897db4e481474a90a33abda9ebc854d41d7c4bfa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd98bd72d61761a1a6257ebd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "メイク直しなんて必要ないわ！\r\n私は常に準備は万全なの！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a46c54744ede601ba65405936d8f0aed3dec4bd4e26c9448e6cdfd45a62b1579",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beecb3e0a260456903c660bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一流とは常に完璧であること。\r\n私が満足するまでやるのよ！\r\n付き合いなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68571491c0f56b682fdc72cbfad672618852cad6e6c7f78fabc21307e607165",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3666b5565791b215da170c71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私を憧れに思ってくれる子が\r\nいるんだもの。期待を裏切らない\r\nように努力を続けないとね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee77bdfeb3bbc78b38a48e467eaab6c550be3cf0a7d1d835347c1aeaa1a7f101",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb10664ae701ebbd681bddd4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いい？病める時も健やかなる時も、\r\n一流のトレーナーとして\r\n最高のトレーニングを志しなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44818976f2e671170cdf4e5ff104fa7413dde4d2c5738d456cb5e4c5042d42b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5995c97625386f45956da8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "常に側にいる人の意見は重要ね。\r\nあなたのおかげで私が『私』を理解\r\nできるようになった気がするもの。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7b790c7b4621b349786fd174ffe3786de5b25cb59d95fbee1402062af7ed219",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0542917a5ab67e11e01d8b3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偉業を成し遂げた時には、あなた\r\nにも一言いってもらうから！\r\n今から考えておきなさいよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96e3bd25e3dcd5fd96f33f6fedcc0c6aa3cd33949f97c9e9b08f669fecfce041",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feef0d8216e0979bfbecf812",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是堪称一流的结果！你也该感到自豪才对！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e8a1d6f8e210c44ee95cecc56686531753181648195b3b4ad96f3b4fd4c6b6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee353f1dfb2d85d9894341d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦ー吼吼吼！这就是一流赛马娘的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eede0f43b1bc17224a50eb5f4a6d5e17fe4b5a028084aaa216e160cc4be4327",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65b50ae1d98e4ee6bf897739",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你变成我的粉丝了？\r\n呵呵，你一直都是吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7eda957321b1aa31e962db5a573fc74d30a592edd62cdb16d2ead135936988d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8f1bb49576f548f4cb20636",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "往后也要继续响应加油声喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec39b477abd03bda7f03510045e0e1467e533ba8d127a9d8d1038f37ea7696dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c8966d16406ade33f25219",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一流の…最高のエスコートだったわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af2525b0055d84b6b78eeca3d8785d2e2a99a07fd3160ba6a9083d1127f53529",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4afa4ead1137b083e0562e28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の選んだ結果だもの、満足しているわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bcc94ebfaa036839672b2a999ff1a36a1b1ec5c09186b1dad8098dd7a923534",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4361938a1e4f65878660055",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我作为一流人士，必须继续成长才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc84c9a8f5ddcaa94b3ebd8ec7e82d8bc7c9670d1790d578a7973c9c8366ddf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:394ea3b3ee646695487879e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦ー吼吼吼！圣王会持续进步的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ff383ff9cde2ee7ecba661b919cd2ec7790167b96f1404f590a8a6e57181b28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc2d9044b074a50d5ddff358",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没错，我就是圣王光环哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "060b0e40997b9960e18343e2a326a736ca62d2782e7c8f3a4b3e1b7801d8f821",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9595ab18facd46c78172603",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是不是变得更可靠了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "94e777fb9b47f896616008831adf1ae7af777e7a8ec27f1b812146695bc8fc18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5e942a3fac393a76fc4917a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来增加支持的范围吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7429db11df8f15e972c5989c847b99aa12c00a6a0a36fa6df8d1cd8eb7489bd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:443934a5e7de7b58f916ce29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想到一个好点子了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5792042dde54fb090a353f8e031a7756b255f03f9c3707a0aeae6060d8dbef3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bbc270bbca9e4005f9fd50d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要将那份期待\r\n全都化为力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b1b717eb4038e4ee28b2bb1c03b50dafc64f20f9261a385382d6b49a4968f5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a5f1229dc87ff6c3c15151a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我将赋予你因获得顶尖级声援\r\n而感激的权力。来吧，抬起头来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "700052c1ac1a3abae982b8d7a84158cf5be59327794c5497e7ebaedb2b7d5038",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4466df165730c02aa810086e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣王要登场了！来吧，准备喊口号！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ec7b8aef1ba6cf818a4fea95c922380fd69bf5dc82c2dfcca9dcbe42ebe6d43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70d33cf55cac3cd60c17f6cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成長を披露してあげるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd46d79a4529b4ec3216e044ade295a3b6d130647b198e30a3055a4f2e6ad874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2442b486865cc57c4c29c099",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "限界の向こう側へ、門出の時よ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd7fbc26600cda6110b7a728dfd62a1786e8664841283ddb0ed6ceb577364d4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1cc891b70517b5b220dca64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来なさい。栄光に向かい、\r\n共に歩む権利をあげる！",
      "source_fingerprint": "958ced8d0c44744e6b1dc061aa2e65d12a3ff3fb1c708ee228b82ea61ea595ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd6af32ab66833bb7349ecd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キングヘイローよ！\r\n共に一流への道を歩みましょう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab0c9f41c9c75b0b2cb4120f28a860be6a97531250d2b50f0d053454b472a59e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4f29d7693cd6f18b0be9cec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，加油咯ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bfbffc1bc9d1f595b2f80d07551bfd5f48273972e52bbe97e12d08f4c09c2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85e04457a50f64a0edd942cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会把『很期待今后』\n变成『今后“也”很期待』的～\n呣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de378385e0ad1eb4029d22b1e5f0048981f54e1faeb8a71a8578acd7c573d839",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5f785ac69b782d6dba7ed51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b0ea50770e74cc57d8f86c94661e324efb2d5121688e3ebb0854357aea8420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb414975938f4e73045fdc24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいまー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b9d600edd4c987f3247b3090a622080abe8e88308dcf78eded0477be4bf5d9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:acbe6b06faa6a2d4f60fbe27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我的一切都挺普通的，\n但我觉得能跟训练员相遇的强运，\n一定是最特别的！尼嘻嘻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fb2f1a0e6693375b061ff85f1a41b066d2391f3c65becc03a7b00edca96a635",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d155fb52d9bbd7b2f372fee4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员累了的时候，\n我随时都会出现的！\n元气，元气的元气满满～～～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6858628115b9a6ce0766a16e8f64f97e0873f2f776e903234577fcf68cc3c38c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e331c2786b45e4398fc4ba5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\n说到新年的话，就不得不提年糕呢～。\n年糕ー糕年ー年糕糕ー♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f7404fdca1a2a6339116cf572523ecdfb2498a70fd0731fd7207d134aaace78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c06344068e902d1dd5deb4de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在情人节专柜里看到了\n各种各样的巧克力…哈！？\n看入迷忘记买了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a05241386f4e19901cec8f43f1373853aa60f4848425832cec0a8b675335fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:597de36ad0e61b1782391d90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节手工做的巧克力\n…果然太普通了吗！？呜呜～\n但是，如果你能收下的话！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a102ab5baec9a8bdb59abc428fbbba44b4b5bbbaae852f27719c50eb6d0a10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "10005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
